description: "-- explicit INNER JOIN ... ON: binds to a real equi-join even at P0\nSELECT c_name, o_orderkey, o_totalprice\nFROM customer INNER JOIN orders ON c_custkey = o_custkey\nWHERE o_totalprice > 50000.0"
expression: rendered
---
